  vocal   8x / 1x        1.01   (must stay inside 0.8-1.25: the scale is
                         per module, and a global one would move this too)

  PASS — the trace scales with the module's own time constant and
  the other modules are untouched. Whether a longer window BUYS
  anything is a separate question, and the answer on record is no:
  eligibility distribution is one of the five refuted conditioning
